                  email = "ernest@guevarra.io", 
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: The International Aid Transparency Initiatives (IATI) is a global
    aid transparency standard and it makes information about aid spending easier
    to access, use and understand using a unified open standard. The IATI
    Application Programming Interface (API) enables IATI standard compliant
    datasets to be easily retrieved. This package provides an interface to the
    IATI API.
